<title>UK: SBC sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>SBC sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 24 million American-style call and put warrants, in eight equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p>TEN WARRANTS REFER TO ONE INDEX.</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	15.JAN.98		 PAYDATE	06.JAN.97</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT    100			 SPOT REF     $748.87</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	 PRICE	PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL	   $760	   $6.20	9.77 PCT    12.08 X</p>
<p> CALL	   $780	   $5.13	11.01 PCT   14.60 X</p>
<p> CALL	   $800	   $4.17	12.40 PCT   17.96 X</p>
<p> CALL	   $820	   $3.33	13.95 PCT   22.49 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $760	   $4.90	-5.06 PCT   15.28 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $780	   $5.83	-3.63 PCT   12.85 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $800	   $6.91	-2.40 PCT   10.84 X</p>
<p> PUT	    $820	   $8.15	-1.38 PCT   9.19 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
